cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Biognosia RAG: retrieval-augmented generation over a biomedical literature knowledge base"
abstract: >-
  Retrieval and serving code for a biomedical retrieval-augmented generation
  system combining dense vector search (Milvus), a knowledge graph (Neo4j),
  BM25/hybrid keyword search (Elasticsearch) and paper metadata (MongoDB), with
  two-stage cross-encoder reranking and grounded, per-passage citations. Usable
  as a Python library or as an MCP server.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tinnlab/biognosia-rag"
date-released: 2025-01-01
version: "1.0.0"

